WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.559
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Sarah. Welcome to Online A one, Book three.

2
00:00:05.859 --> 00:00:08.781
Hi! I'm Rithy. Let's learn together!

3
00:00:09.081 --> 00:00:15.240
Unit three: Birthday Party. In this unit, you will talk about a birthday party in the past.

4
00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:17.077
Birthday.

5
00:00:17.777 --> 00:00:20.415
Birthday means the day of the year when you were born.

6
00:00:20.715 --> 00:00:22.331
My birthday is in May.

7
00:00:23.031 --> 00:00:25.846
Your turn. Say: Birthday.

8
00:00:28.546 --> 00:00:29.431
Birthday.

9
00:00:30.417 --> 00:00:31.104
Cake.

10
00:00:31.804 --> 00:00:35.569
Cake means a sweet food you eat on special days.

11
00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:37.462
We ate a chocolate cake.

12
00:00:38.162 --> 00:00:40.802
Your turn. Say: Cake.

13
00:00:43.502 --> 00:00:44.202
Cake.

14
00:00:45.217 --> 00:00:45.928
Present.

15
00:00:46.628 --> 00:00:49.451
Present means something you give to someone.

16
00:00:49.751 --> 00:00:51.554
I got a present from my aunt.

17
00:00:52.254 --> 00:00:55.231
Your turn. Say: Present.

18
00:00:57.931 --> 00:00:58.653
Present.

19
00:00:59.650 --> 00:01:00.454
Balloon.

20
00:01:01.154 --> 00:01:04.767
Balloon means a small rubber bag filled with air.

21
00:01:05.067 --> 00:01:06.985
The balloons were red and blue.

22
00:01:07.685 --> 00:01:10.593
Your turn. Say: Balloon.

23
00:01:13.293 --> 00:01:14.074
Balloon.

24
00:01:15.083 --> 00:01:16.050
Invite.

25
00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:20.061
Invite means to ask someone to come to a party.

26
00:01:20.361 --> 00:01:22.105
I invited ten friends.

27
00:01:22.805 --> 00:01:25.632
Your turn. Say: Invite.

28
00:01:28.332 --> 00:01:29.333
Invite.

29
00:01:30.317 --> 00:01:31.132
Guest.

30
00:01:31.832 --> 00:01:34.795
Guest means a person who comes to your party or home.

31
00:01:35.095 --> 00:01:36.874
The guests sang a song.

32
00:01:37.574 --> 00:01:40.273
Your turn. Say: Guest.

33
00:01:42.973 --> 00:01:43.730
Guest.

34
00:01:44.717 --> 00:01:45.590
Candle.

35
00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:49.102
Candle means a stick of wax that gives light.

36
00:01:49.402 --> 00:01:51.204
There were nine candles on the cake.

37
00:01:51.904 --> 00:01:54.557
Your turn. Say: Candle.

38
00:01:57.257 --> 00:01:58.084
Candle.

39
00:01:59.083 --> 00:01:59.887
Wish.

40
00:02:00.587 --> 00:02:02.784
Wish means to want something to happen.

41
00:02:03.084 --> 00:02:05.351
I closed my eyes and made a wish.

42
00:02:06.051 --> 00:02:09.005
Your turn. Say: Wish.

43
00:02:11.705 --> 00:02:12.416
Wish.

44
00:02:13.417 --> 00:02:14.174
Song.

45
00:02:14.874 --> 00:02:17.605
Song means music with words that you sing.

46
00:02:17.905 --> 00:02:19.893
Everyone sang the birthday song.

47
00:02:20.593 --> 00:02:23.373
Your turn. Say: Song.

48
00:02:26.073 --> 00:02:26.761
Song.

49
00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:28.426
Gift.

50
00:02:29.126 --> 00:02:31.184
Gift means another word for a present.

51
00:02:31.484 --> 00:02:32.740
Thank you for the gift!

52
00:02:33.440 --> 00:02:36.139
Your turn. Say: Gift.

53
00:02:38.839 --> 00:02:39.515
Gift.

54
00:02:40.517 --> 00:02:41.367
Card.

55
00:02:42.067 --> 00:02:45.413
Card means a folded paper with a picture and a message.

56
00:02:45.713 --> 00:02:47.469
My friend made me a card.

57
00:02:48.169 --> 00:02:50.972
Your turn. Say: Card.

58
00:02:53.672 --> 00:02:54.453
Card.

59
00:02:55.450 --> 00:02:56.463
Celebrate.

60
00:02:57.163 --> 00:03:01.310
Celebrate means to do something fun on a special day.

61
00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:03.308
We celebrated at home.

62
00:03:04.008 --> 00:03:07.229
Your turn. Say: Celebrate.

63
00:03:09.929 --> 00:03:10.768
Celebrate.

64
00:03:11.783 --> 00:03:13.922
Now let's listen to a conversation.

65
00:03:14.222 --> 00:03:16.884
Rithy, how was your birthday party?

66
00:03:18.183 --> 00:03:21.161
It was great! I invited twelve friends.

67
00:03:22.450 --> 00:03:23.567
Did you have a cake?

68
00:03:24.883 --> 00:03:27.603
Yes, we had a big cake with ten candles.

69
00:03:28.917 --> 00:03:30.150
What did you get?

70
00:03:31.450 --> 00:03:34.683
I got a book and a card. I gave cake to everyone!

71
00:03:35.983 --> 00:03:39.597
Grammar focus: Past simple (irregular verbs).

72
00:03:39.897 --> 00:03:42.561
We had a cake. I got many presents.

73
00:03:42.861 --> 00:03:48.276
Some verbs don't add -ed in the past. Learn them: had, got, gave, ate, sang.

74
00:03:49.283 --> 00:03:52.284
Now read and listen. My Tenth Birthday.

75
00:03:52.584 --> 00:03:55.036
Last Saturday was my tenth birthday.

76
00:03:56.350 --> 00:03:58.953
I invited twelve guests to my party.

77
00:04:00.250 --> 00:04:03.573
We had a big cake with ten candles, and I made a wish.

78
00:04:04.883 --> 00:04:08.334
My friends sang a song and gave me presents and cards.

79
00:04:09.650 --> 00:04:13.231
We celebrated all afternoon. It was the best day!

80
00:04:14.517 --> 00:04:17.134
Quiz time! Choose the correct answer.

81
00:04:17.434 --> 00:04:19.794
Last year, I blank a big cake.

82
00:04:20.094 --> 00:04:23.352
A, have. B, had. C, has.

83
00:04:27.350 --> 00:04:29.651
The answer is B: had.

84
00:04:31.150 --> 00:04:33.579
I blank many presents on my birthday.

85
00:04:33.879 --> 00:04:36.952
A, got. B, get. C, getting.

86
00:04:40.950 --> 00:04:43.333
The answer is A: got.

87
00:04:44.817 --> 00:04:47.420
A person who comes to your party is a blank.

88
00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:51.350
A, guest. B, candle. C, card.

89
00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:57.083
The answer is A: guest.

90
00:04:58.583 --> 00:05:02.490
Now it's your turn to speak. Describe your last birthday party.

91
00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:13.925
On my last birthday, I had a party at home. My friends came, we ate cake and I got a new bag.

92
00:05:14.225 --> 00:05:15.853
Excellent answer, Rithy!

93
00:05:16.850 --> 00:05:21.708
Great work today! You learned twelve new words and past simple (irregular verbs).

94
00:05:22.008 --> 00:05:26.181
Today's value is generosity. Give gifts and kind words.

95
00:05:26.481 --> 00:05:29.029
See you in Unit four. Goodbye!

96
00:05:29.329 --> 00:05:32.202
Thank you, Ms. Sarah! Bye, everyone!

